  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Place haloumi in a medium bowl and cover with water. Set aside to soak.\n• Cut potato into fries and place on the lined oven tray. Sprinkle with homestyle seasoning and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat and bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6707783f66150a260f49c71e-2b58cd41.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, grate carrot. Thinly slice pear into wedges. Finely chop or crush garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6707783f66150a260f49c71e-65628d4a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When fries have 5 mins remaining, drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm slices.\n• In a medium frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side. Cook in batches if your pan is getting crowded.\n• Add garlic, the honey and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using), and cook, turning, until coated, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6707783f66150a260f49c71e-71b1bdc6.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine salad leaves, pear, carrot and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season and toss to combine.\n• Divide sticky garlic chilli haloumi, seasoned fries and pear salad between plates.\n• Serve with the mayonnaise.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6707783f66150a260f49c71e-87b540c3.jpeg"
    }
  ]
